(Seeded PRNG: a linear congruential generator. Deterministic per seed,
 which is what makes every finding reproducible from its seed alone.)

a number called rng_state is 12345.

To 'rng seed' with a number called s.
    Set rng_state to s.

To 'rng next'.
    Set rng_state to rng_state multiply 1103515245.
    Set rng_state to rng_state add 12345.
    Set rng_state to rng_state modulo 2147483648.
    Return a number, rng_state.

To 'rng below' with a number called nn.
    a number called r is 'rng next'.
    Return a number, r modulo nn.